Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:01:08.03,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,54)\fad(200,0)\fnRoundHog SemiBold\fs34\c&H001CCEFF}Justin D'Souza (Asymptote Labs)
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:01:08.03,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“Agents triage every
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:01:08.03,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}incoming PR and issue for
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:01:08.03,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}security”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:01.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,we did a launch for our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.48,0:00:02.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,open source project
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:03.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,Beacon, and we got like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.92,0:00:05.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,an influx of dozens and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.68,0:00:06.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,dozens of PRs and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:08.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,issues. For what it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.63,0:00:09.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,worth, like our own for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.67,0:00:10.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,our own setup
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.49,0:00:12.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,we have infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.57,0:00:14.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,to basically just get
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.49,0:00:15.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,webhooks anytime someone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.77,0:00:17.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,files an issue or a PR.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.49,0:00:19.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,And we have a security
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.93,0:00:21.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,agent and kind of like a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:23.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,code verification agent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:24.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,try to put out like a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:26.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,remediation for the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:27.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,issue, try to do like a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:28.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,security stress test on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.98,0:00:31.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,the PR content.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.22,0:00:32.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,And then also look at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:33.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,the author of the issue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.96,0:00:35.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,or the PR to understand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:36.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,trustworthiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.78,0:00:38.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,A lot of the original
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.02,0:00:38.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,external contributors
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:40.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,outside of the founding
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.20,0:00:41.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,team of Asymptote were
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.71,0:00:43.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,people we knew through
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.21,0:00:44.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,our Discord community
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.55,0:00:45.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,but now just completely
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.57,0:00:46.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,random people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.09,0:00:47.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,and some of them are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.05,0:00:48.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,super prolific open
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:49.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,source contributors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.54,0:00:50.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Some of them have no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.76,0:00:52.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,contributions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.14,0:00:53.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Some of them put out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.08,0:00:54.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,slop and it's like very
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.14,0:00:55.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,subtle fixes that like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:56.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,don't really do anything
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.22,0:00:57.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the project.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.86,0:00:58.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,But some of them are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.48,0:00:59.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,like real gaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.40,0:01:00.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,And so we're trying to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:02.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,build systems to like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.58,0:01:03.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,really automatically
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.68,0:01:05.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,determine like what are
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:07.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,meaningful issues or
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.37,0:01:08.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,PRs.
